    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "Guess vs plan",
      "text": "<b>Estará en casa</b> (guess, now) vs <b>Estará en casa mañana</b> (prediction). Context decides. In the past the conditional takes over: <i>Estaría en casa</i> (I guess he was at home)."
    },
